       {"paragraph_no":9,"kind":"SYNTHESIS","text":"So what did SB 1570 actually build? Not a bridge, school, plant, or guaranteed pipeline. It built a lawful route by which certain Illinois public owners can buy design and construction together, with public notice, professional scope-setting, scored qualifications, controlled price weighting, and written accountability.","support_fact_ids":["authority","advance_notice","scope","phase_one","phase_two","reporting"],"word_count":47},
